WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:09,050
Seven to eight thousand people can feed them for a lifetime.

2
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,140
Get on the bus and return to base

3
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:26,530
Lord Ling, you are here

4
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:29,540
