6
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:34,940
Come here, I'll tell you the rules of the base.

7
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:37,750
from today

8
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:40,750
Everyone who joins my base uses the points system

9
